@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

actor "用户" as User
participant "Fcitx5" as Fcitx
participant "Voime addon" as Addon
participant "voimed" as Daemon
participant "目标应用" as App

User -> Fcitx : 按下 Hotkey
Fcitx -> Addon : InputContextKeyEvent
Addon -> Addon : 绑定目标
Addon -> Fcitx : filterAndAccept()
Addon -> Daemon : Start / Toggle

loop 录音期间
  Daemon -> Addon : Partial
  Addon -> Fcitx : setPreedit(Partial)
  Fcitx -> User : 临时窗口
end

User -> Fcitx : 松开 / 再按
Fcitx -> Addon : 结束事件
Addon -> Daemon : Stop
Daemon -> Addon : Final
Addon -> Fcitx : 清空 preedit
Addon -> Fcitx : commitString(Final)
Fcitx -> App : 插入文本
@enduml
